#: ../../source/docs/common-rtf.rst:36 f2dd41e20ad342ac9c97ed7bcc1b59c4
msgid ""
"If you are a manufacturer of a RTF vehicle based on ArduPilot and do not "
"appear in this list, please get in touch through one of the methods listed "
"on our :ref:`Contact Us page <common-contact-us>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您是基于ArduPilot的RTF飞行器制造商但未出现在此列表中，请通过 :ref:`联系我们页面 <common-contact-us>` "
"上列出的任一方式与我们联系。"

